{"seq":1,"slug":"communication-theory","title":"传播学理论","stage":"DONE","category":"media-communication","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory","rating":{"composite":3.56,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.21,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"传播学理论-简介\">传播学理论 简介</h1><p>传播学理论是理解人类信息交流活动规律的基础学科，为分析媒体现象、舆论传播和社会沟通提供了系统的理论框架。从拉斯韦尔的经典传播模式到当代的网络传播理论，传播学在一个多世纪的发展中积累了丰富的理论成果，这些理论不仅具有学术价值，更是分析当代媒体生态和信息传播的重要工具。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向对传播学有兴趣的中高级技术人员和内容从业者，适合从事内容运营、新媒体传播、公共关系和品牌传播等方向的专业人士。</p>\n<p>全书分为三章，系统梳理传播学的核心理论体系：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>经典传播理论</strong>介绍拉斯韦尔传播模式、香农-韦弗模型和议程设置理论等奠基性理论，帮助读者建立传播学的基本认知框架。第二章<strong>媒介效果研究</strong>深入讲解涵化理论、沉默的螺旋和框架理论等关于媒体如何影响受众认知和行为的重要理论。第三章<strong>受众与接收</strong>聚焦使用与满足理论、编码与解码和积极受众等以受众为中心的理论视角。</p>\n<p>建议读者按章节顺序学习，先掌握经典理论建立学科基础，再理解媒介效果的作用机制，最后从受众视角完成对传播过程的全面认知。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"classical-theories","title":"经典传播理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/classical-theories","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lasswell-model","title":"拉斯韦尔传播模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/classical-theories/lasswell-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"shannon-weaver","title":"香农-韦弗传播模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/classical-theories/shannon-weaver"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agenda-setting","title":"议程设置理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/classical-theories/agenda-setting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"media-effects","title":"媒介效果研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/media-effects","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cultivation-theory","title":"涵化理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/media-effects/cultivation-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spiral-of-silence","title":"沉默的螺旋","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/media-effects/spiral-of-silence"},{"seq":3,"slug":"framing-theory","title":"框架理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/media-effects/framing-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"audience-reception","title":"受众与接收","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/audience-reception","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"uses-gratifications","title":"使用与满足理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/audience-reception/uses-gratifications"},{"seq":2,"slug":"encoding-decoding","title":"编码与解码理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/audience-reception/encoding-decoding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"active-audience","title":"积极受众理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/media-communication/communication-theory/audience-reception/active-audience"}]}]}